module

public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.DeRham.RelativeInverseImageUnitSections
public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.DeRham.SmoothFiltrationExteriorStep
public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.DeRham.WedgeComponentGeneratedEpi
public import StacksFrontier.Algebra.Category.ModuleCat.Sheaf.AbelianOfSmallSite
public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.DeRham.WedgeFiltrationDegreewise

/-!
# Section 50.12's degreewise step, with no hypothesis left

Let `f : X ⟶ Y` be a morphism of schemes over a base `S`, with `g : Y ⟶ S` the structure
morphism of the target. The identification of the degree-`m` term of the `k`-th step of Section
50.12's filtration of the complex `Ω^•_{X/S}` with the step at `k` of the filtration of the
single sheaf `Ω^m_{X/S}` is proved in
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.DeRham.SmoothFiltrationExteriorStep` up to one hypothesis: that

`f^{-1}Ω^k_{Y/S} ⊗_A Ω^{m-k}_{X/S} ⟶ (⋀^k(f^*Ω_{Y/S}) ⊗_{𝒪_X} Ω^{m-k}_{X/S})|_A`

is an epimorphism, `A` being the base ring sheaf `(f∘g)^{-1}𝒪_S`. **This file discharges it.**

By `AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.epi_tensorFunctor_map_comp_laxComparison` the epimorphy
holds as soon as the image of the comparison `c_k : f^{-1}Ω^k_{Y/S} ⟶ (⋀^k(f^*Ω_{Y/S}))|_A`
generates `⋀^k(f^*Ω_{Y/S})` locally over `𝒪_X`, and that generation is formal: a pullback of
sheaves of modules is locally generated by the pullback-unit sections
(`Stacks.PullbackUnitGenerators.mem_localUnitSpan`), the comparison
`Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageToPullback` carries the pullback-unit sections of
`f^{-1}Ω^k_{Y/S}` to exactly those sections
(`Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageToPullback_pullbackUnitSection`), and `c_k` is
that comparison followed by the isomorphism `f^*(⋀^kΩ_{Y/S}) ≅ ⋀^k(f^*Ω_{Y/S})` of
[Stacks, Tag 01CI], along which local generation transports
(`AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.mem_localSpan_comparisonSections_of_iso`).

## Main results

* `Stacks.DeRhamSmooth.mem_localSpan_comparisonSections_relativeInverseImageToPullback`: **a
  pullback `f^*F` is locally generated over `𝒪_X` by the image of the comparison
  `f^{-1}F ⟶ f^*F`** of sheaves of `(f∘g)^{-1}𝒪_S`-modules, and
  `Stacks.DeRhamSmooth.mem_localSpan_comparisonSections_pulledBackFormsComparison` the same for
  `⋀^k(f^*Ω_{Y/S})` and the comparison `c_k`.
* `Stacks.DeRhamSmooth.epi_pulledBackFormsComparison_tensor_comp_laxComparison`: **the surjection
  of Section 50.12**, which is the surjective half of the underived identity
  `F ⊗_{𝒪_X} f^*G ≅ F ⊗_{f^{-1}𝒪_Y} f^{-1}G` of [Stacks, Tag 08DE] in the form that section
  uses it.
* `Stacks.DeRhamSmooth.mapSubobjects_wedgeFiltrationStep_eq_exteriorFiltration'`: **the
  degree-`m` term of the `k`-th step of Section 50.12's filtration of the complex `Ω^•_{X/S}` is
  the step at `k` of the filtration of the sheaf `Ω^m_{X/S}` by the forms pulled back from
  `Y`**, with no hypothesis beyond `1 ≤ k ≤ m`.

## Implementation notes

**Nothing is assumed about `f`.** In particular `f` is not assumed smooth, although
[Stacks, Section 0FMK] works with a smooth morphism: neither the comparison of the two
filtrations nor the surjection above uses the differentials sequence of `f`, let alone its local
splitting. Smoothness enters Section 0FMK only in the identification of the graded pieces, which
is not part of this statement.

**The spellings of the module pullback agree by `rfl`.** Local generation is available for
`RingedSpaceModuleAdjunction.modulePullback`, the de Rham comparison is written with
`RingedSpaceModuleAdjunction.pullback`, and the sheaves of differential forms live in
`AlgebraicGeometry.Scheme.Modules.pullback`; all three unfold to `SheafOfModules.pullback` at the
same morphism of sheaves of rings, so the generation statement instantiates with no transport.
The same holds for the two spellings of a pullback-unit section,
`Stacks.PullbackUnitGenerators.pullbackUnitSection` and
`Stacks.Tag01VSPullbackTensor.modulesPullbackUnit`, which is why the `HEq` argument of
`Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageToPullback_pullbackUnitSection` is discharged by
`HEq.refl` here.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 0FMK](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0FMK)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 08DE](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/08DE)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 01CI](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01CI)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0FKP](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0FKP)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

open AlgebraicGeometry CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits Opposite TopologicalSpace
open RingedSpaceModuleAdjunction
open Stacks.PullbackUnitGenerators

universe u

namespace Stacks.DeRhamSmooth

variable {X Y S : Scheme.{u}} (f : X ⟶ Y) (g : Y ⟶ S) (F : Y.Modules)

/-- **A pullback-unit section of `f^*F` is in the image of the comparison `f^{-1}F ⟶ f^*F`**, and
so is each of its restrictions: the comparison carries the pullback-unit section of `f^{-1}F`
attached to a local section `s` of `F` to the pullback-unit section of `f^*F` attached to `s`
(`Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageToPullback_pullbackUnitSection`), and the
restrictions are handled by naturality. -/
theorem mem_comparisonSections_of_mem_unitSections
    (W : (Opens X.carrier)ᵒᵖ) (x : ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj F).val.obj W)
    (hx : x ∈ unitSections f.toLRSHom.toShHom F W) :
    x ∈ AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.comparisonSections
      (φ := AlgebraicGeometry.inverseImageStructureMap (f ≫ g))
      (M := (Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj F)
      (Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageToPullback f g F) W := by
  obtain ⟨V, k, s, rfl⟩ := hx
  refine ⟨((Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImage f g).obj
    ((_root_.pushforward (Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.toInverseImageBase g)).obj F)).val.map k
      (pullbackUnitSection (Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageProjection f g)
        ((_root_.pushforward (Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.toInverseImageBase g)).obj F) V s), ?_⟩
  refine Eq.trans (PresheafOfModules.naturality_apply
    (Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageToPullback f g F).val k _) ?_
  exact congrArg (fun t => ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj F).val.map k t)
    (Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageToPullback_pullbackUnitSection f g F V s _
      (HEq.refl _))

/-- **A pullback of sheaves of modules is locally generated over `𝒪_X` by the image of the
comparison `f^{-1}F ⟶ f^*F`**: every local section of `f^*F` lies in the local `𝒪_X`-span of
that image. This is local generation by the pullback-unit sections
(`Stacks.PullbackUnitGenerators.mem_localUnitSpan`) together with the fact that those sections
are in the image of the comparison. -/
theorem mem_localSpan_comparisonSections_relativeInverseImageToPullback
    (W : (Opens X.carrier)ᵒᵖ) (x : ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj F).val.obj W) :
    x ∈ (Stacks.SheafOfModules.localSpan ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj F)
      (AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.comparisonSections
        (φ := AlgebraicGeometry.inverseImageStructureMap (f ≫ g))
        (M := (Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj F)
        (Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageToPullback f g F))).obj W :=
  AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.mem_localSpan_map (𝟙 ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj F))
    (mem_comparisonSections_of_mem_unitSections f g F)
    (mem_localUnitSpan f.toLRSHom.toShHom F W x)

/-- **`⋀^k(f^*Ω_{Y/S})` is locally generated over `𝒪_X` by the image of
`Stacks.DeRhamSmooth.pulledBackFormsComparison`**: the previous statement carried along the
comparison of [Stacks, Tag 01CI]. Every implicit argument is pinned by name — left to
unification, recovering the base ring sheaf from the type of the comparison
`f^{-1}Ω^k_{Y/S} ⟶ f^*Ω^k_{Y/S}` exhausts the default heartbeat budget in `isDefEq`, because
the restriction of scalars appears there in its direct-image spelling. -/
theorem mem_localSpan_comparisonSections_pulledBackFormsComparison (k : ℕ)
    (W : (Opens X.carrier)ᵒᵖ)
    (x : ((pulledBackDifferentialsAlgebras f g).exteriorPower k).val.obj W) :
    x ∈ (Stacks.SheafOfModules.localSpan
      ((pulledBackDifferentialsAlgebras f g).exteriorPower k)
      (AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.comparisonSections
        (φ := AlgebraicGeometry.inverseImageStructureMap (f ≫ g))
        (M := (pulledBackDifferentialsAlgebras f g).exteriorPower k)
        (pulledBackFormsComparison f g k))).obj W :=
  AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.mem_localSpan_comparisonSections_of_iso
    (X := X.toRingedSpace)
    (A := (TopCat.Sheaf.pullback CommRingCat.{u} (f ≫ g).base).obj S.sheaf)
    (φ := AlgebraicGeometry.inverseImageStructureMap (f ≫ g))
    (Q := (pulledBackDeRhamComplex f g).X k)
    (M := (Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialForms g (k : ℤ)))
    (M' := (pulledBackDifferentialsAlgebras f g).exteriorPower k)
    (Stacks.DeRhamDirectImage.relativeInverseImageToPullback f g
      (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialForms g (k : ℤ)))
    (pulledBackFormsIso f g k)
    (mem_localSpan_comparisonSections_relativeInverseImageToPullback f g
      (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialForms g (k : ℤ))) W x

/-- **The surjection of Stacks Section 50.12.** The comparison

`f^{-1}Ω^k_{Y/S} ⊗_A Ω^j_{X/S} ⟶ (⋀^k(f^*Ω_{Y/S}) ⊗_{𝒪_X} Ω^j_{X/S})|_A`

of sheaves of `A = (f∘g)^{-1}𝒪_S`-modules is an epimorphism. This is the surjective half of the
underived identity `F ⊗_{𝒪_X} f^*G ≅ F ⊗_{f^{-1}𝒪_Y} f^{-1}G` of [Stacks, Tag 08DE] in the form
Section 50.12 uses, and it holds because `⋀^k(f^*Ω_{Y/S})` is locally generated over `𝒪_X` by the
image of `f^{-1}Ω^k_{Y/S}`: a local pure tensor `(b·c(ω)) ⊗ η` of the target is then the image of
`ω ⊗ (b·η)`. -/
theorem epi_pulledBackFormsComparison_tensor_comp_laxComparison (k j : ℕ) :
    Epi (((Stacks.SheafOfModules.Tensor.sheafTensor.{u, u, u, u, u}
          ((TopCat.Sheaf.pullback CommRingCat.{u} (f ≫ g).base).obj S.sheaf)).map
        (pulledBackFormsComparison f g k)).app
          ((_root_.SheafOfModules.restrictScalars.{u}
            (AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.underlyingRingHom
              (φ := AlgebraicGeometry.inverseImageStructureMap (f ≫ g)))).obj
            ((Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g)).exteriorPower j)) ≫
      Stacks.SheafOfModules.TensorRestrictScalars.laxComparison
        ((TopCat.Sheaf.pullback CommRingCat.{u} (f ≫ g).base).obj S.sheaf) X.sheaf
        (AlgebraicGeometry.inverseImageStructureMap (f ≫ g))
        ((pulledBackDifferentialsAlgebras f g).exteriorPower k)
        ((Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g)).exteriorPower j)) :=
  AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.epi_tensorFunctor_map_comp_laxComparison
    (X := X.toRingedSpace)
    (A := (TopCat.Sheaf.pullback CommRingCat.{u} (f ≫ g).base).obj S.sheaf)
    (φ := AlgebraicGeometry.inverseImageStructureMap (f ≫ g))
    (Q := (pulledBackDeRhamComplex f g).X k)
    (M := (pulledBackDifferentialsAlgebras f g).exteriorPower k)
    (pulledBackFormsComparison f g k)
    ((Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g)).exteriorPower j)
    (mem_localSpan_comparisonSections_pulledBackFormsComparison f g k)

/-! The abelian structures of the two categories of sheaves of modules, named rather than
searched for, exactly as in
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.DeRham.WedgeFiltrationExteriorStep`. -/
attribute [local instance] Stacks.SheafOfModules.abelianOfSmallSite
attribute [local instance] AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.abelianModules

/-- **The degree-`m` term of the `k`-th step of the filtration of Stacks Section 50.12 is the
step at `k` of the filtration of `Ω^m_{X/S}` by the forms pulled back from `Y`**, for
`1 ≤ k ≤ m`, with no hypothesis left. On the left the `k`-th step of
`Stacks.DeRhamSmooth.deRhamSmoothFiltration` evaluated in degree `m`; on the right
`AlgebraicGeometry.Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialsExteriorFiltration` at `k`, read over the
base ring sheaf `(f∘g)^{-1}𝒪_S` and pushed into the degree-`m` term of the extension by zero of
the de Rham complex.

This is `Stacks.DeRhamSmooth.mapSubobjects_wedgeFiltrationStep_eq_exteriorFiltration` with its
epimorphy hypothesis discharged by
`Stacks.DeRhamSmooth.epi_pulledBackFormsComparison_tensor_comp_laxComparison`. It is the
comparison [Stacks, Section 0FMK] needs in order to read its sheaf-level identification of the
graded pieces on the filtration of the complex. -/
theorem mapSubobjects_wedgeFiltrationStep_eq_exteriorFiltration'
    (k m : ℕ) (hk0 : 0 < k) (hk : k ≤ m) :
    (mapSubobjects (HomologicalComplex.eval _ (ComplexShape.up ℤ) (m : ℤ))
          (AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.deRhamComplexInt
            (Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g))
            (AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.deRhamDifferential
              (Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g))))).obj
        (AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.wedgeFiltrationStep
          (Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g))
          (AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.deRhamDifferential
            (Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g)))
          (pulledBackDeRhamComplex f g)
          (Stacks.DeRhamPullback.deRhamPullbackChain f g) (k : ℤ)) =
      (_root_.CategoryTheory.Subobject.map
            ((AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.deRhamComplex
                (Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g))
                (AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.deRhamDifferential
                  (Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g)))).extendXIso
              ComplexShape.embeddingUpNat (i := m) (i' := (m : ℤ)) rfl).inv).obj
        ((AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.exteriorPowerSubobjectRestriction
            (Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras (f ≫ g)) m).obj
          (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialsExteriorFiltration f g m k)) :=
  mapSubobjects_wedgeFiltrationStep_eq_exteriorFiltration f g k m hk0 hk
    (epi_pulledBackFormsComparison_tensor_comp_laxComparison f g k (m - k))

end Stacks.DeRhamSmooth

end
